This package vendors a static build (linked-libs/<target>/libbox3d.a) of Box3D,
by Erin Catto, licensed under the MIT License. The full license text is in
LICENSE.box3d.mit. See https://github.com/erincatto/box3d.

Box3D itself is not redistributed as source here; it is a git submodule under
vendor/box3d, built by scripts/build-box3d.sh.

The shipped library is a modified build of Box3D. It is built from the vendored sources with the
patches listed in the source repository's patches/series applied. The modifications:

- add the apronSides field to b3HeightFieldDef, which lets the edge flags of a height field agree
  with a neighbouring height field, and replace a sphere's edge or vertex contact on such an edge
  with the contact against the plane of the triangle;
- add b3World_ShiftOrigin, which moves the world origin in one pass, and record it as a new
  recording op;
- add b3World_SetContactMaterialCallback, b3ContactMaterialFcn and b3ContactMaterial, which let
  the application override the material of each touching contact before the solver runs.

